{
  "title": "Vibrant Egyptian Fish Skewers",
  "description": "A funky and juicy Egyptian dish featuring sashimi-cut fish, monterey jack cheese, and a blend of spices, all cooked to perfection in a wok. This halal-friendly recipe is perfect for a dinner party.",
